    },
    "body": "DeepSeek Flash can run UOR-R4 research from Kimi Desktop with project-scoped authority, nine specialist roles, and K3 Max reserved for consequential mathematical and architecture review. The team protocol gives every subagent an explicit source/artifact packet and separates implementation, first-principles challenge, evidence audit, cost review and delivery. It also requires exact negative-result scope: one failed or faulty panel cannot retire a whole geometric mechanism family. The root README links the optional workspace.\n\nNo model or research result changes in this PR. Credentials, local MCP settings, the one-message launcher and session traces remain outside the repository.\n\nValidation: `kimi doctor` passed; a live Kimi session called the read-only `uor_knowledge` MCP; DeepSeek delegated successfully to `uor-history-curator`; DeepSeek explicitly delegated `uor-architect-reviewer` to K3; `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` and `git diff --check` passed. These smoke tests establish routing/configuration, not model competence.\n\nReferences #820.\n",
